  WHAT THIS FILE IS
  The archived migrated side unit test report for the single test class
  com.armedia.acm.auth.AcmLoginSuccessOperationsTest in the module directory
  acm-service-login, whose reactor targets JDK 17. It is part of the evidence that makes the
  no disabling of failing tests rule, labelled R-5 here, verifiable rather than merely
  asserted. With nine testcases it is the largest report in this folder, which also makes it
  the most tempting place for a quietly dropped or skipped method; all nine are present below
